{
  "id": "ROM.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Rumi 7",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasinal aba geeshooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi moanali (gideaba ng'asheesu geabalooli fuga nal deaweeda) gideaba deaweeda goobal siida ii duweamajeegi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gatmooda mideawa siyeeda nirada deaweeda aba siyeeda damanda duu ea majeegiin, ama muchu nea ghami siyeeda, abeeda ea siitin deaweedeedida bea siyeedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi abeeda gajeeguura gili mealuul iimideayi sea ng'eedeeda nuut iidu ea majeek siyeadaanyi. Ama meah siyeadaanyi abeeda gaygoobal geaw aba deaweedeedida, ama ghoah siinuut abeeda ea mamealuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwasunu ea fuga eaduupcheewi, eara agooga noomeewsi deaweeda, aba saseeda Gristo, ak ghoahuuyi haleanjeemba siinuut, siida ghayi duuna jeeda miyeeda ak abeeda geenyaksi ASEETA haghweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba damanda duu eepiideewana saseeda aba gasooda riing'eeda, mida aba badayda deaweeda, sin gadiyeeda aba sasanuukaasa ak iidu gwajiilsa miyeeda haghweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghamneawa ea siitineasa aba jeeda deaweeda, aba gideaba simeewiisi gidaghayi nung' eahuuwa giing'oonyanga, ak abeeda ea meegadiyeeni aba hiing'eadayda deaweedeeda sing'waar geaghus aba jeeda Guroorooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweeda ea riing'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajeeyeenaan? Neada deaweeda ea riing'eedea? Eara gwasa! Gwachi iimanda deaweeda, gwachi ea maydanal riing'eeda. Ak ea maydanal geawunda gheang'da iimarukuna deaweeda nea gwayi, “Adishti ghaang'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwanyas gheata riing'eeda aba diigheandida, ak gwasin aba jeedeanyu haleanjeeda sean siimu eeshissa ghaang'. Aba gideaba riing'eeda ii manda deaweeda ea nimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda geawooschi majeek nea abeeda ea manda deaweeda, ama muchu nea ghwahidu diigheanda, gamajeegiit riing'eeda ak ghaameayi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak diigheandida jea gweadu eaweegean gweadu miyeeda heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba riing'eeda ghwanyas gheata aba diigheanda, gwareenganean amang'ata gwanuusan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi deaweeda ea ghaydit, ak diigheanda earada ea ghaydit nea gabiissa ea doabiiwaat, ak ea miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi gidida miyiin niyeadu miyeeda heedeanyu aniini? Eara gwasa! Riing'eeda gil, ak gweadu miyeeda jeedeanyu ak gwajakta gidamiy, ak abeeda geahiimu riing'eeda gideaba riing'eeda, ak aba naweeda diigheanda ghwanyas riing'eeda haw mwoamu eeteen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda mida jeesiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba geanali beadi deaweeda gaba guroorooda; amaduuku aniini geawooschi siida beachi saseeda, sishaaydaawa jeeda riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini mwaanali eara gideasinyi, aba gideaba iissa gidida aabwariinyiin ea maydasin, iissa geasinyi gidida mwaabwariinyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geasinyi gidida mwaabwariinyiin, abeeda ghaamwaschi gideaba deaweeda aamiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa mii aniini gil deasin ng'asheesu, gwasin riing'eedida mida jeedeanyuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghaanali gideaba jeedeanyu manda gidamiy, nih aba saseedeanyu. Iissa geagasayi dasin gil doabiiw, ak ea maydasin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gidida miy aabwariinyiin iissa ea measini, iissa geasinyi gida mwaabwariinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa iissa iyeasinyi gidida meagassiin, measini aniini nea gabwageaw, iissa gwasin riing'eedida mida jeedeanyuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi naadaayi deaweedeani gideaba aniineeda gasa gwasin ng'asheanda miyiin iissa gwaneawu ng'asheanda muy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba geahoosasi deaweedeeda ASEETA aba jeedeanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu ghaadaayi aba saseedeanyu deaweeda nuut nea gang'uchi sea deaweedeeda fughareedeanyu ak ghwanung' doaw giing'oonyaneeda deaweedeeda riing'eeda mida jeeda saseedeanyuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini meahoosani earahay! Nih gajea ng'eaha gil jea gwalealnanean saseani bea miyeedean? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geabadiischeesi ASEETA aba Yesu Gristoyda was Ng'utamiideanya! Asi iisunu aniini geagadiyeesi deaweedeeda ASEETA aba fughareedeanyu nea aba saseedeanyu geagadiyeesi deaweedeeda riing'eeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
